{"strongs": "H2821", "word": "חָשַׁךְ", "translit": "cha.shakh", "root": "חשך", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "be, grow dark", "definition": "חָשַׁךְ verb be, grow dark (Late Hebrew id. ; Aramaic חֲשַׁךְ , ; Arabic bear rancour , see Lag BN 30 ) — Qal Perfect ׳ ח Isa 5:30 + 4 t.; וְחָֽשְׁכָה consecutive Mic 3:6 (but see below); חָֽשְׁכוּ Lam 5:17 וְחָֽשְׁכוּ consecutive Eccl 12:3 Imperfect 3 feminine singular תֶּחְשַׁךְ Eccl 12:2 וַתֶּחְשַׁךְ Exod 10:15 3 masculine plural יֶחְשְׁכוּ Job 3:9 3 feminine plural תֶּחְשַׁכְנָה Ps 69:24 — 1. be, grow dark , אוֺר Isa 5:30 , compare (figurative) Job 18:6 הַשֶּׁמֶשׁ Isa 13:10 (figurative); היום Ezek 30:18 (where read חשׁך , for ᵑ0 Baer חשׂך ); Job 3:9 (subject כוכבים ), compare Eccl 12:2 (subject השׁמשׁ , האור , הירח , הכוכבים ); impersonal Mic 3:6 (si vera 1.; but read probably וַחֲשֵׁכָה , corresponding with לַיְלָה preceding). 2. have a dark colour: מִשְּׁחוֺר ׳ ח תָּֽאֳרָם Lam 4:8 darker than blackness is their visage ; of the earth הָאֶרֶץ Exod 10:15 . 3. grow dim Lam 5:17 (subject עינינו ), compare Ps 69:24 (figurative), Eccl 12:3 subject הָראֹוֺת i.e. the eyes. Hiph`il Perfect הֶחְשִׁיךְ Amos 5:8 , וְהַחֲשַׁכְתִּ֫י Amos 8:9 Imperfect יַחֲשִׁיךְ Ps 139:12 יַחְשִׁךְ Jer 13:16 וַיַּחְשִׁךְ Ps 105:28 Participle מַחְשִׁיךְ Job 38:2 — 1. make dark , ׳ יום לילה הח Amos 5:8 absolute cause darkness Jer 13:16 ; Ps 105:28 , compare Amos 8:9 ( לארץ ). 2. = hide, conceal , followed by מִמֶּךָּ Ps 139:12 . 3. figurative obscure, confuse Job 38:2 (object עֵצָה ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3218')\">BDB3218</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2821')\">H2821</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3217')\">BDB3217</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3219')\">BDB3219</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חָשַׁךְ</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>be, grow dark</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>; Aramaic <bdbarc>חֲשַׁךְ</bdbarc>, <placeholder2028/>; Arabic <placeholder2029/> <highlight>bear rancour</highlight>, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>BN 30</sup></lookup>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 5:30\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,30)\">Isa 5:30</ref> + 4 t.; <bdbheb>וְחָֽשְׁכָה</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Mic 3:6\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(33,3,6)\">Mic 3:6</ref> (but see below); <bdbheb>חָֽשְׁכוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 5:17\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(25,5,17)\">Lam 5:17</ref> <bdbheb>וְחָֽשְׁכוּ</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Eccl 12:3\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(21,12,3)\">Eccl 12:3</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>תֶּחְשַׁךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 12:2\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(21,12,2)\">Eccl 12:2</ref> <bdbheb>וַתֶּחְשַׁךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 10:15\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(2,10,15)\">Exod 10:15</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>יֶחְשְׁכוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 3:9\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(18,3,9)\">Job 3:9</ref> 3 feminine plural <bdbheb>תֶּחְשַׁכְנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 69:24\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"69\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"69\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(19,69,24)\">Ps 69:24</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>be, grow dark</highlight>, <bdbheb>אוֺר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 5:30\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,30)\">Isa 5:30</ref>, compare (figurative) <ref ref=\"Job 18:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,18,6)\">Job 18:6</ref> <bdbheb>הַשֶּׁמֶשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 13:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,13,10)\">Isa 13:10</ref> (figurative); <bdbheb>היום</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 30:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,30,18)\">Ezek 30:18</ref> (where read <bdbheb>חשׁך</bdbheb>, for <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Baer')\">Baer</lookup> <bdbheb>חשׂך</bdbheb>); <ref ref=\"Job 3:9\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(18,3,9)\">Job 3:9</ref> (subject <bdbheb>כוכבים</bdbheb>), compare <ref ref=\"Eccl 12:2\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(21,12,2)\">Eccl 12:2</ref> (subject <bdbheb>השׁמשׁ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>האור</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>הירח</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>הכוכבים</bdbheb>); impersonal <ref ref=\"Mic 3:6\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(33,3,6)\">Mic 3:6</ref> (si vera 1.; but read probably <bdbheb>וַחֲשֵׁכָה</bdbheb>, corresponding with <bdbheb>לַיְלָה</bdbheb> preceding). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>have a dark colour:</highlight> <bdbheb>מִשְּׁחוֺר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <bdbheb>תָּֽאֳרָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 4:8\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(25,4,8)\">Lam 4:8</ref> <highlight>darker than blackness is their visage</highlight>; of the earth <bdbheb>הָאֶרֶץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 10:15\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(2,10,15)\">Exod 10:15</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>grow dim</highlight> <ref ref=\"Lam 5:17\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(25,5,17)\">Lam 5:17</ref> (subject <bdbheb>עינינו</bdbheb>), compare <ref ref=\"Ps 69:24\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"69\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"69\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(19,69,24)\">Ps 69:24</ref> (figurative), <ref ref=\"Eccl 12:3\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(21,12,3)\">Eccl 12:3</ref> subject <bdbheb>הָראֹוֺת</bdbheb> i.e. the eyes. <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>הֶחְשִׁיךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 5:8\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(30,5,8)\">Amos 5:8</ref>, <bdbheb>וְהַחֲשַׁכְתִּ֫י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 8:9\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(30,8,9)\">Amos 8:9</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יַחֲשִׁיךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 139:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"139\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"139\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,139,12)\">Ps 139:12</ref> <bdbheb>יַחְשִׁךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 13:16\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,16)\">Jer 13:16</ref><bdbheb>וַיַּחְשִׁךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 105:28\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"105\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"105\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(19,105,28)\">Ps 105:28</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מַחְשִׁיךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 38:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,2)\">Job 38:2</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>make dark</highlight>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יום לילה הח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 5:8\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(30,5,8)\">Amos 5:8</ref> absolute <highlight>cause darkness</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jer 13:16\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,16)\">Jer 13:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 105:28\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"105\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"105\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(19,105,28)\">Ps 105:28</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Amos 8:9\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(30,8,9)\">Amos 8:9</ref> (<bdbheb>לארץ</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> = <highlight>hide, conceal</highlight>, followed by <bdbheb>מִמֶּךָּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 139:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"139\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"139\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,139,12)\">Ps 139:12</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> figurative <highlight>obscure, confuse</highlight> <ref ref=\"Job 38:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,2)\">Job 38:2</ref> (object <bdbheb>עֵצָה</bdbheb>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 5:30", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 5, "verse": 30}, {"raw": "Mic 3:6", "book": "MIC", "chapter": 3, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Lam 5:17", "book": "LAM", "chapter": 5, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Eccl 12:3", "book": "ECC", "chapter": 12, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Eccl 12:2", "book": "ECC", "chapter": 12, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Exod 10:15", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 10, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Job 3:9", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 3, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ps 69:24", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 69, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Job 18:6", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 18, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Isa 13:10", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 13, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Ezek 30:18", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 30, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Lam 4:8", "book": "LAM", "chapter": 4, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Amos 5:8", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 5, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Amos 8:9", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 8, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ps 139:12", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 139, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Jer 13:16", "book": "JER", "chapter": 13, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Ps 105:28", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 105, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Job 38:2", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 38, "verse": 2}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["חָשַׁךְ", "׳", "ח", "וְחָֽשְׁכָה", "חָֽשְׁכוּ", "וְחָֽשְׁכוּ", "תֶּחְשַׁךְ", "וַתֶּחְשַׁךְ", "יֶחְשְׁכוּ", "תֶּחְשַׁכְנָה", "אוֺר", "הַשֶּׁמֶשׁ", "היום", "חשׁך", "ᵑ0", "חשׂך", "כוכבים", "השׁמשׁ", "האור", "הירח", "הכוכבים", "וַחֲשֵׁכָה", "לַיְלָה", "מִשְּׁחוֺר", "תָּֽאֳרָם", "הָאֶרֶץ", "עינינו", "הָראֹוֺת", "הֶחְשִׁיךְ", "וְהַחֲשַׁכְתִּ֫י", "יַחֲשִׁיךְ", "יַחְשִׁךְ", "וַיַּחְשִׁךְ", "מַחְשִׁיךְ", "יום לילה הח", "לארץ", "מִמֶּךָּ", "עֵצָה"], "aramaic": ["חֲשַׁךְ"], "greek": [], "tr